#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:102
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:103
msgid ""
"**Multi-font purpose**: DM Sans = UI workhorse (body, nav, buttons); "
"Outfit = geometric display (headings, product names); Poppins = friendly "
"mid-tier (sub-headings, features); Roboto = technical/data contexts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:104
msgid ""
"**Universal 1.50 line-height**: The overwhelming majority of text uses "
"1.50 line-height, creating a consistent reading rhythm regardless of font"
" or size. Exceptions: display (1.10 tight) and some captions (1.70 "
"relaxed)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:105
msgid ""
"**Weight 500 as default emphasis**: Most headings use 500 (medium) rather"
" than bold, creating a modern, approachable tone. 600 for section titles,"
" 700 reserved for strong emphasis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:106
msgid ""
"**Compact hierarchy**: The size scale jumps from 80px display straight to"
" 28–32px section, then 16–20px body — a deliberate compression that keeps"
" the visual hierarchy feeling efficient."
msgstr ""

