#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:209
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: MiniMax uses a distinctive purple-tinted shadow "
"(`rgba(44, 30, 116, ...)`) for featured elements, creating a subtle "
"brand-color glow that connects the shadow system to the blue brand "
"identity. Standard shadows use neutral black but at low opacity (0.08), "
"keeping everything feeling light and airy. The directional shadow variant"
" (6.5px offset) adds dimensional interest to hero product cards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:211
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:213
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:214
msgid "Use white as the dominant background — let product cards provide the color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:215
msgid "Apply pill radius (9999px) for navigation tabs and toggle buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:216
msgid "Use generous border radius (20px–24px) for product showcase cards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:217
msgid "Employ the purple-tinted shadow for featured/hero product cards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:218
msgid ""
"Keep body text at DM Sans weight 400–500 — heavier weights for buttons "
"only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:219
msgid "Use Outfit for display headings, DM Sans for everything functional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:220
msgid "Maintain the universal 1.50 line-height across body text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:221
msgid ""
"Let colorful product illustrations/gradients serve as the primary visual "
"interest"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:223
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:224
msgid ""
"Don't add colored backgrounds to main content sections — white is "
"structural"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:225
msgid ""
"Don't use sharp corners (0–4px radius) on product cards — the rounded "
"aesthetic is core"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:226
msgid ""
"Don't apply the brand pink (`#ea5ec1`) to text or buttons — it's for logo"
" and decorative accents only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:227
msgid ""
"Don't mix more than one display font per section (Outfit OR Poppins, not "
"both)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:228
msgid ""
"Don't use weight 700 for headings — 500–600 is the range, 700 is reserved"
" for strong emphasis in body text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:229
msgid ""
"Don't darken shadows beyond 0.16 opacity — the light, airy feel requires "
"restraint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:230
msgid "Don't use Roboto for headings — it's the data/technical context font only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:232
msgid "8. Responsive Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md
msgid "Single column, stacked product cards, hamburger nav"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md
msgid "2-column product grids, condensed spacing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md
msgid "Full horizontal card layouts, expanded spacing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:241
msgid "Collapsing Strategy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:242
msgid "Hero: 80px → responsive scaling to ~40px on mobile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:243
msgid "Product card grid: horizontal scroll → 2-column → single column stacked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:244
msgid "Navigation: horizontal → hamburger menu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:245
msgid "Footer: multi-column → stacked sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_minimax.md:246
msgid "Spacing: 64–80px gaps → 32–40px on mobile"
msgstr ""

